    "This helps identify who logged what when sharing with family.": {
      "comment": "Text displayed in a footer below the \"Track who logs each event when sharing with family.\" setting in the User Profile screen.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "This is their story. Not all of it — the best parts happened between the logged moments. The head on your lap. The excited spin at the door. The way they looked at you.\n\nThose don't need an app to remember.": {
      "comment": "Final message in the \"Moments\" section of the memory book, summarizing the most meaningful moments of a dog's life.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta es su historia. No toda — las mejores partes pasaron entre los momentos registrados. La cabeza en tu regazo. El giro emocionado en la puerta. La forma en que te miraban.\n\nEsos no necesitan una app para recordar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C'est leur histoire. Pas tout — les meilleurs moments se sont passés entre les événements enregistrés. La tête sur vos genoux. Le tournoiement excité à la porte. La façon dont il vous regardait.\n\nCeux-là n'ont pas besoin d'une app pour s'en souvenir."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Denna is their story. Not Alla av it — the Bäst parts happened between the logged moments. The head På your lap. The excited spin Kl the door. The way they looked Kl you.\n\nThose don't need an app Till remember."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "This will delete all events, profile, and sync data. The app will restart fresh. This cannot be undone.": {
      "comment": "An alert message in the DebugSection that explains the consequences of resetting all data.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies löscht alle Ereignisse, Profil- und Synchronisierungsdaten. Die App startet neu. Dies kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto eliminara todos los eventos, perfil y datos de sincronizacion. La app comenzara de nuevo. Esto no se puede deshacer."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ceci supprimera tous les événements, le profil et les données de synchronisation. L'app redémarrera à zéro. Cette action est irréversible."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo eliminerà tutti gli eventi, il profilo e i dati di sincronizzazione. L'app ripartirà da zero. Non può essere annullato."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Denna will Radera Alla Händelser, Profil, and Synkronisera Data. The app will restart fresh. Denna cannot be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will delete both the sleep and wake-up events.": {
